#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"SVr2; marked as LEGACY in POSIX.1-2001.  POSIX.1-2008 removes the "
"specifications of B<ecvt>()  and B<fcvt>(), recommending the use of "
"B<sprintf>(3)  instead (though B<snprintf>(3)  may be preferable)."
msgstr ""
"SVr2, marqué comme «\\ LEGACY\\ » dans POSIX.1-2001. POSIX.1-2008 supprime "
"les spécifications de B<ecvt>() et B<fcvt>() et recommande à la place "
"l'utilisation de B<sprintf>(3) (bien que B<snprintf>(3) soit préférable)."

